/*!
\page page_stl3algorithminfo StL3AlgorithmInfo

\brief Per-algorithm configuration and event counters for a single L3 online trigger algorithm.

\section stl3algorithminfo_overview Overview
\c StL3AlgorithmInfo stores the configuration and per-event results for one L3 online
trigger algorithm.  It records whether the algorithm was enabled, whether it accepted
the current event, whether it requested full TPC reconstruction, run-segment cumulative
counters, pre- and post-scale factors, algorithm-specific integer and floating-point
configuration parameters, and per-event result data words.

\section stl3algorithminfo_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
 └── StObject
      └── StL3AlgorithmInfo
\endcode

\section stl3algorithminfo_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| Int_t | mId | Algorithm identifier |
| Bool_t | mOn | Algorithm was enabled |
| Bool_t | mAccept | Algorithm accepted this event |
| Bool_t | mBuild | Full TPC build requested |
| Int_t | mNumberOfProcessedEvents | Cumulative processed events |
| Int_t | mNumberOfAcceptedEvents | Cumulative accepted events |
| Int_t | mNumberOfBuildEvents | Cumulative build-requested events |
| UShort_t | mDataSize | Per-event data word count |
| TArrayF | mDataArray | Per-event floating-point data |
| Int_t | mPreScale | Pre-scale factor |
| Int_t | mPostScale | Post-scale factor |
| UShort_t | mIntParameterSize | Integer config parameter count |
| TArrayI | mIntParameterArray | Integer config parameters |
| UShort_t | mFloatParameterSize | Float config parameter count |
| TArrayF | mFloatParameterArray | Float config parameters |

\section stl3algorithminfo_methods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `int id() const` | Algorithm identifier |
| `bool on() const` | Algorithm enabled flag |
| `bool accept() const` | Event accept flag |
| `bool build() const` | Full build requested flag |
| `int numberOfProcessedEvents() const` | Cumulative processed count |
| `int numberOfAcceptedEvents() const` | Cumulative accepted count |
| `int numberOfBuildEvents() const` | Cumulative build count |
| `int dataSize() const` | Per-event data word count |
| `float data(int index) const` | Per-event data word at index |
| `int preScale() const` | Pre-scale factor |
| `int postScale() const` | Post-scale factor |
| `int intParameter(int i) const` | Integer config param i |
| `float floatParameter(int i) const` | Float config param i |

\section stl3algorithminfo_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StL3EventSummary* sum = event->l3Trigger()->l3EventSummary();
for (int i = 0; i < sum->numberOfAlgorithms(); ++i) {
    StL3AlgorithmInfo* alg = sum->algorithms()[i];
    if (alg->accept())
        cout << "Alg " << alg->id() << " accepted (preScale=" << alg->preScale() << ")" << endl;
}
\endcode

\see \ref page_stl3eventsummary
\see \ref page_stl3trigger
*/
